(2, 'BRD-001', 'Premium Milk Bread', 'প্রিমিয়াম মিল্ক ব্রেড / দুধের রুটি', 'premium-milk-bread', '<p>Indulge in our <strong>DELECTABLE</strong> Premium Milk Bread</strong>, a truly foundation of great meals that has been captivating taste buds for generations. Each creation that leaves our bakery represents the pinnacle of culinary craftsmanship, bringing together time-honored traditions and modern excellence. Our master bakers pour their passion and expertise into every single freshly baked bread, ensuring that you <sup> receive nothing short of perfection.</p>\n\n<p>The journey of our <strong>Premium Milk Bread</strong> begins long before it reaches your table, starting with the careful selection of only the <strong>top-quality</strong> ingredients sourced from trusted suppliers who share our commitment to quality. We believe that exceptional food should be an experience that engages all your senses, from the moment you first see its <strong>fresh</strong> appearance to the lingering satisfaction after the last bite.</p>\n\n<p>What truly sets our <strong>Premium Milk Bread</strong> apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and the pursuit of excellence in every aspect of preparation. From ingredient selection through final packaging, each step undergoes thorough inspection. Our facility adheres to international food safety standards and undergoes regular audits. We believe that quality ingredients make all the difference in the final product. That\'s why we source premium flour, fresh dairy, real spices, and quality sweeteners. Our <strong>Premium Milk Bread</strong> reflects this dedication to using only the best inputs. When you choose our products, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations.</p>\n\n<p>The flavor profile of our <strong>Premium Milk Bread</strong> is nothing short of <strong>signature</strong>, presenting a harmonious symphony of <strong>satisfyingly simple</strong> and <strong>hearty</strong> notes that dance gracefully across your palate. Our culinary artisans have spent years perfecting this distinctive character, carefully balancing each element to achieve a taste that is both memorable and deeply satisfying.</p>\n\n<p>The texture is gloriously <strong>perfectly chewy</strong> and <strong>dense</strong>, creating a mouthfeel that provides the perfect complement to the rich flavors. When you take your first bite of our <strong>Premium Milk Bread</strong>, you will immediately notice the <strong>authentic</strong> aroma that rises to greet you, hinting at the delicious experience to come. As you continue to savor each morsel, layers of complexity unfold, revealing subtle nuances that make our <strong>freshly baked bread</strong> truly unique.</p>\n\n<p>Customers frequently describe the experience as <strong>exquisite</strong> and <strong>outstanding</strong>, often remarking how the various flavor components work together in perfect harmony without any single note overwhelming the others. We take great pride in achieving this delicate balance, understanding that the best flavors are those that evolve as you eat, revealing new dimensions with each bite.</p>\n\n<p>The finish is clean yet memorable, leaving a pleasant reminder of the <strong>divine</strong> experience that invites you to return for more.</p>\n\n<p>At our establishment, quality is not merely a goal but the very foundation upon which we build everything we create. Every <strong>Premium Milk Bread</strong> is prepared fresh using only the <strong>celebrated</strong> ingredients available, with absolutely no compromises on quality or freshness. We take great pride in our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers who share our dedication to excellence and sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>freshly baked bread</strong> begins with <strong>sea salt</strong> and <strong>filtered water</strong>, each ingredient carefully chosen for its superior quality and contribution to the final product. Our skilled artisans combine traditional techniques passed down through generations with modern innovations to create products that are both authentically crafted and exceptionally delicious.</p>\n\n<p>The result is a product that not only tastes <strong>extraordinary</strong> but also meets the most stringent standards of food safety and hygiene. We maintain rigorous quality control processes at every stage, from ingredient selection through preparation to final packaging, ensuring that what reaches you is nothing short of perfect.</p>\n\n<p>Our facility undergoes regular audits and adheres to international food safety standards because we believe you deserve complete confidence in every product you purchase from us. When you choose our <strong>Premium Milk Bread</strong>, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations and a dedication to excellence that will never waver.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>Premium Milk Bread</strong> is the perfect choice for <strong>dinner accompaniment</strong> and <strong>bread pudding</strong>, bringing joy and satisfaction to any occasion. The versatile nature of this <strong>amazing</strong> freshly baked bread</strong> makes it equally suitable for casual family gatherings and formal celebrations alike.</p>\n\n<p>Present it at your next dinner party to impress guests with its exceptional quality and <strong>striking</strong> presentation that speaks to refined taste. Many of our loyal customers order our <strong>Premium Milk Bread</strong> specifically for holidays, festivals, and milestone celebrations where only the finest will do.</p>\n\n<p>It also makes for a thoughtful and appreciated gift, showing care in selection and an understanding of quality that recipients immediately recognize. Whether you are hosting an elaborate event or enjoying a quiet moment of personal indulgence, our <strong>Premium Milk Bread</strong> rises magnificently to every occasion.</p>\n\n<p>We offer elegant custom packaging options for gifting purposes, ensuring that your present looks as <strong>breathtaking</strong> as it tastes.</p>\n\n<p>To preserve the <strong>supreme</strong> quality and freshness of our <strong>Premium Milk Bread</strong>, we recommend storing it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources. For optimal enjoyment, consume within 2-3 days of purchase, though our delicious creations rarely last that long once discovered. If refrigeration is recommended, please refer to the specific storage guidelines on the packaging for best results.</p>\n\n<p>Our eco-friendly packaging is thoughtfully designed to maintain freshness while minimizing environmental impact. We suggest allowing refrigerated items to come to room temperature before serving to fully appreciate the <strong>incredible</strong> flavors and textures our bakers intended.</p>\n\n<p>Avoid storing near strong-smelling foods as our products may absorb surrounding odors.</p>', 'তাজা দুধ দিয়ে তৈরি সমৃদ্ধ ও ক্রিমি মিল্ক ব্রেড। নরম টেক্সচার এবং হালকা মিষ্টি স্বাদ যা মুখে গলে যায়। সকালের টোস্ট বা স্যান্ডউইচের জন্য আদর্শ।', 80.00, NULL, 49, 3, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-12 09:30:01', '2026-03-30 06:21:52'),
(3, 'BRD-002', 'Whole Wheat Bread', 'গমের আটার রুটি', 'whole-wheat-bread', '<p>Indulge in our <strong>REMARKABLE</strong> Whole Wheat Bread</strong>, a truly wholesome staple of artisan baking that has been captivating taste buds for generations. Each creation that leaves our bakery represents the pinnacle of culinary craftsmanship, bringing together time-honored traditions and modern excellence. Our master bakers pour their passion and expertise into every single freshly baked bread, ensuring that you <sup> receive nothing short of perfection.</p>\n\n<p>The journey of our <strong>Whole Wheat Bread</strong> begins long before it reaches your table, starting with the careful selection of only the <strong>rich</strong> ingredients sourced from trusted suppliers who share our commitment to quality. We believe that exceptional food should be an experience that engages all your senses, from the moment you first see its <strong>rewarding</strong> appearance to the lingering satisfaction after the last bite.</p>\n\n<p>What truly sets our <strong>Whole Wheat Bread</strong> apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and the pursuit of excellence in every aspect of preparation. From ingredient selection through final packaging, each step undergoes thorough inspection. Our facility adheres to international food safety standards and undergoes regular audits. We believe that quality ingredients make all the difference in the final product. That\'s why we source premium flour, fresh dairy, real spices, and quality sweeteners. Our <strong>Whole Wheat Bread</strong> reflects this dedication to using only the best inputs. When you choose our products, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations.</p>\n\n<p>The flavor profile of our <strong>Whole Wheat Bread</strong> is nothing short of <strong>fantastic</strong>, presenting a harmonious symphony of <strong>hearty</strong> and <strong>rustic</strong> notes that dance gracefully across your palate. Our culinary artisans have spent years perfecting this distinctive character, carefully balancing each element to achieve a taste that is both memorable and deeply satisfying.</p>\n\n<p>The texture is gloriously <strong>airy</strong> and <strong>well-structured</strong>, creating a mouthfeel that provides the perfect complement to the rich flavors. When you take your first bite of our <strong>Whole Wheat Bread</strong>, you will immediately notice the <strong>sensational</strong> aroma that rises to greet you, hinting at the delicious experience to come. As you continue to savor each morsel, layers of complexity unfold, revealing subtle nuances that make our <strong>freshly baked bread</strong> truly unique.</p>\n\n<p>Customers frequently describe the experience as <strong>premium</strong> and <strong>specialty</strong>, often remarking how the various flavor components work together in perfect harmony without any single note overwhelming the others. We take great pride in achieving this delicate balance, understanding that the best flavors are those that evolve as you eat, revealing new dimensions with each bite.</p>\n\n<p>The finish is clean yet memorable, leaving a pleasant reminder of the <strong>optimal</strong> experience that invites you to return for more.</p>\n\n<p>At our establishment, quality is not merely a goal but the very foundation upon which we build everything we create. Every <strong>Whole Wheat Bread</strong> is prepared fresh using only the <strong>flawless</strong> ingredients available, with absolutely no compromises on quality or freshness. We take great pride in our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers who share our dedication to excellence and sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>freshly baked bread</strong> begins with <strong>filtered water</strong> and <strong>olive oil</strong>, each ingredient carefully chosen for its superior quality and contribution to the final product. Our skilled artisans combine traditional techniques passed down through generations with modern innovations to create products that are both authentically crafted and exceptionally delicious.</p>\n\n<p>The result is a product that not only tastes <strong>scrumptious</strong> but also meets the most stringent standards of food safety and hygiene. We maintain rigorous quality control processes at every stage, from ingredient selection through preparation to final packaging, ensuring that what reaches you is nothing short of perfect.</p>\n\n<p>Our facility undergoes regular audits and adheres to international food safety standards because we believe you deserve complete confidence in every product you purchase from us. When you choose our <strong>Whole Wheat Bread</strong>, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations and a dedication to excellence that will never waver.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>Whole Wheat Bread</strong> is the perfect choice for <strong>bread pudding</strong> and <strong>breakfast toast</strong>, bringing joy and satisfaction to any occasion. The versatile nature of this <strong>wholesome</strong> freshly baked bread</strong> makes it equally suitable for casual family gatherings and formal celebrations alike.</p>\n\n<p>Present it at your next dinner party to impress guests with its exceptional quality and <strong>heavenly</strong> presentation that speaks to refined taste. Many of our loyal customers order our <strong>Whole Wheat Bread</strong> specifically for holidays, festivals, and milestone celebrations where only the finest will do.</p>\n\n<p>It also makes for a thoughtful and appreciated gift, showing care in selection and an understanding of quality that recipients immediately recognize. Whether you are hosting an elaborate event or enjoying a quiet moment of personal indulgence, our <strong>Whole Wheat Bread</strong> rises magnificently to every occasion.</p>\n\n<p>We offer elegant custom packaging options for gifting purposes, ensuring that your present looks as <strong>timeless</strong> as it tastes.</p>\n\n<p>To preserve the <strong>fresh</strong> quality and freshness of our <strong>Whole Wheat Bread</strong>, we recommend storing it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources. For optimal enjoyment, consume within 2-3 days of purchase, though our delicious creations rarely last that long once discovered. If refrigeration is recommended, please refer to the specific storage guidelines on the packaging for best results.</p>\n\n<p>Our eco-friendly packaging is thoughtfully designed to maintain freshness while minimizing environmental impact. We suggest allowing refrigerated items to come to room temperature before serving to fully appreciate the <strong>renowned</strong> flavors and textures our bakers intended.</p>\n\n<p>Avoid storing near strong-smelling foods as our products may absorb surrounding odors.</p>', 'আঁশ ও পুষ্টিতে ভরপুর ১০০% গমের আটার রুটি। ঘন, পুষ্টিকর টেক্সচার বাদামি স্বাদ সহ। স্বাস্থ্য সচেতনদের জন্য উপযোগী।', 90.00, 81.00, 58, 3, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-12 09:30:01', '2026-03-30 06:21:52'),
(4, 'BRD-003', 'Brown Bread', 'ব্রাউন ব্রেড / গুড়ের রুটি', 'brown-bread', '<p>Indulge in our <strong>DAZZLING</strong> Brown Bread</strong>, a truly daily essential crafted with care that has been captivating taste buds for generations. Each creation that leaves our bakery represents the pinnacle of culinary craftsmanship, bringing together time-honored traditions and modern excellence. Our master bakers pour their passion and expertise into every single freshly baked bread, ensuring that you <sup> receive nothing short of perfection.</p>\n\n<p>The journey of our <strong>Brown Bread</strong> begins long before it reaches your table, starting with the careful selection of only the <strong>delectable</strong> ingredients sourced from trusted suppliers who share our commitment to quality. We believe that exceptional food should be an experience that engages all your senses, from the moment you first see its <strong>preferred</strong> appearance to the lingering satisfaction after the last bite.</p>\n\n<p>What truly sets our <strong>Brown Bread</strong> apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and the pursuit of excellence in every aspect of preparation. From ingredient selection through final packaging, each step undergoes thorough inspection. Our facility adheres to international food safety standards and undergoes regular audits. We believe that quality ingredients make all the difference in the final product. That\'s why we source premium flour, fresh dairy, real spices, and quality sweeteners. Our <strong>Brown Bread</strong> reflects this dedication to using only the best inputs. When you choose our products, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations.</p>\n\n<p>The flavor profile of our <strong>Brown Bread</strong> is nothing short of <strong>ideal</strong>, presenting a harmonious symphony of <strong>rustic</strong> and <strong>earthy</strong> notes that dance gracefully across your palate. Our culinary artisans have spent years perfecting this distinctive character, carefully balancing each element to achieve a taste that is both memorable and deeply satisfying.</p>\n\n<p>The texture is gloriously <strong>dense</strong> and <strong>crusty</strong>, creating a mouthfeel that provides the perfect complement to the rich flavors. When you take your first bite of our <strong>Brown Bread</strong>, you will immediately notice the <strong>magnificent</strong> aroma that rises to greet you, hinting at the delicious experience to come. As you continue to savor each morsel, layers of complexity unfold, revealing subtle nuances that make our <strong>freshly baked bread</strong> truly unique.</p>\n\n<p>Customers frequently describe the experience as <strong>perfect</strong> and <strong>finest</strong>, often remarking how the various flavor components work together in perfect harmony without any single note overwhelming the others. We take great pride in achieving this delicate balance, understanding that the best flavors are those that evolve as you eat, revealing new dimensions with each bite.</p>\n\n<p>The finish is clean yet memorable, leaving a pleasant reminder of the <strong>intense</strong> experience that invites you to return for more.</p>\n\n<p>At our establishment, quality is not merely a goal but the very foundation upon which we build everything we create. Every <strong>Brown Bread</strong> is prepared fresh using only the <strong>timeless</strong> ingredients available, with absolutely no compromises on quality or freshness. We take great pride in our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers who share our dedication to excellence and sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>freshly baked bread</strong> begins with <strong>olive oil</strong> and <strong>stone-ground flour</strong>, each ingredient carefully chosen for its superior quality and contribution to the final product. Our skilled artisans combine traditional techniques passed down through generations with modern innovations to create products that are both authentically crafted and exceptionally delicious.</p>\n\n<p>The result is a product that not only tastes <strong>vivid</strong> but also meets the most stringent standards of food safety and hygiene. We maintain rigorous quality control processes at every stage, from ingredient selection through preparation to final packaging, ensuring that what reaches you is nothing short of perfect.</p>\n\n<p>Our facility undergoes regular audits and adheres to international food safety standards because we believe you deserve complete confidence in every product you purchase from us. When you choose our <strong>Brown Bread</strong>, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations and a dedication to excellence that will never waver.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>Brown Bread</strong> is the perfect choice for <strong>breakfast toast</strong> and <strong>lunch sandwiches</strong>, bringing joy and satisfaction to any occasion. The versatile nature of this <strong>nutritious</strong> freshly baked bread</strong> makes it equally suitable for casual family gatherings and formal celebrations alike.</p>\n\n<p>Present it at your next dinner party to impress guests with its exceptional quality and <strong>mouthwatering</strong> presentation that speaks to refined taste. Many of our loyal customers order our <strong>Brown Bread</strong> specifically for holidays, festivals, and milestone celebrations where only the finest will do.</p>\n\n<p>It also makes for a thoughtful and appreciated gift, showing care in selection and an understanding of quality that recipients immediately recognize. Whether you are hosting an elaborate event or enjoying a quiet moment of personal indulgence, our <strong>Brown Bread</strong> rises magnificently to every occasion.</p>\n\n<p>We offer elegant custom packaging options for gifting purposes, ensuring that your present looks as <strong>profound</strong> as it tastes.</p>\n\n<p>To preserve the <strong>traditional</strong> quality and freshness of our <strong>Brown Bread</strong>, we recommend storing it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources. For optimal enjoyment, consume within 2-3 days of purchase, though our delicious creations rarely last that long once discovered. If refrigeration is recommended, please refer to the specific storage guidelines on the packaging for best results.</p>\n\n<p>Our eco-friendly packaging is thoughtfully designed to maintain freshness while minimizing environmental impact. We suggest allowing refrigerated items to come to room temperature before serving to fully appreciate the <strong>famous</strong> flavors and textures our bakers intended.</p>\n\n<p>Avoid storing near strong-smelling foods as our products may absorb surrounding odors.</p>', 'শস্য গমের আটা থেকে তৈরি পুষ্টিকর ব্রাউন ব্রেড। আঁশে সমৃদ্ধ, ঘন টেক্সচার এবং মাটির স্বাদ।', 85.00, NULL, 20, 3, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-12 09:30:01', '2026-03-30 06:21:52'),
(5, 'BRD-004', 'Garlic Bread', 'রসুনের রুটি / রসুন ব্রেড', 'garlic-bread', '<p>Indulge in our <strong>SUPERIOR</strong> Garlic Bread</strong>, a truly foundation of great meals that has been captivating taste buds for generations. Each creation that leaves our bakery represents the pinnacle of culinary craftsmanship, bringing together time-honored traditions and modern excellence. Our master bakers pour their passion and expertise into every single freshly baked bread, ensuring that you <sup> receive nothing short of perfection.</p>\n\n<p>The journey of our <strong>Garlic Bread</strong> begins long before it reaches your table, starting with the careful selection of only the <strong>rewarding</strong> ingredients sourced from trusted suppliers who share our commitment to quality. We believe that exceptional food should be an experience that engages all your senses, from the moment you first see its <strong>dazzling</strong> appearance to the lingering satisfaction after the last bite.</p>\n\n<p>What truly sets our <strong>Garlic Bread</strong> apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and the pursuit of excellence in every aspect of preparation. From ingredient selection through final packaging, each step undergoes thorough inspection. Our facility adheres to international food safety standards and undergoes regular audits. We believe that quality ingredients make all the difference in the final product. That\'s why we source premium flour, fresh dairy, real spices, and quality sweeteners. Our <strong>Garlic Bread</strong> reflects this dedication to using only the best inputs. When you choose our products, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations.</p>\n\n<p>The flavor profile of our <strong>Garlic Bread</strong> is nothing short of <strong>finest</strong>, presenting a harmonious symphony of <strong>earthy</strong> and <strong>nutty</strong> notes that dance gracefully across your palate. Our culinary artisans have spent years perfecting this distinctive character, carefully balancing each element to achieve a taste that is both memorable and deeply satisfying.</p>\n\n<p>The texture is gloriously <strong>well-structured</strong> and <strong>soft</strong>, creating a mouthfeel that provides the perfect complement to the rich flavors. When you take your first bite of our <strong>Garlic Bread</strong>, you will immediately notice the <strong>optimal</strong> aroma that rises to greet you, hinting at the delicious experience to come. As you continue to savor each morsel, layers of complexity unfold, revealing subtle nuances that make our <strong>freshly baked bread</strong> truly unique.</p>\n\n<p>Customers frequently describe the experience as <strong>striking</strong> and <strong>acclaimed</strong>, often remarking how the various flavor components work together in perfect harmony without any single note overwhelming the others. We take great pride in achieving this delicate balance, understanding that the best flavors are those that evolve as you eat, revealing new dimensions with each bite.</p>\n\n<p>The finish is clean yet memorable, leaving a pleasant reminder of the <strong>classic</strong> experience that invites you to return for more.</p>\n\n<p>At our establishment, quality is not merely a goal but the very foundation upon which we build everything we create. Every <strong>Garlic Bread</strong> is prepared fresh using only the <strong>legendary</strong> ingredients available, with absolutely no compromises on quality or freshness. We take great pride in our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers who share our dedication to excellence and sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>freshly baked bread</strong> begins with <strong>stone-ground flour</strong> and <strong>natural sourdough starter</strong>, each ingredient carefully chosen for its superior quality and contribution to the final product. Our skilled artisans combine traditional techniques passed down through generations with modern innovations to create products that are both authentically crafted and exceptionally delicious.</p>\n\n<p>The result is a product that not only tastes <strong>magnificent</strong> but also meets the most stringent standards of food safety and hygiene. We maintain rigorous quality control processes at every stage, from ingredient selection through preparation to final packaging, ensuring that what reaches you is nothing short of perfect.</p>\n\n<p>Our facility undergoes regular audits and adheres to international food safety standards because we believe you deserve complete confidence in every product you purchase from us. When you choose our <strong>Garlic Bread</strong>, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations and a dedication to excellence that will never waver.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>Garlic Bread</strong> is the perfect choice for <strong>lunch sandwiches</strong> and <strong>dinner accompaniment</strong>, bringing joy and satisfaction to any occasion. The versatile nature of this <strong>unforgettable</strong> freshly baked bread</strong> makes it equally suitable for casual family gatherings and formal celebrations alike.</p>\n\n<p>Present it at your next dinner party to impress guests with its exceptional quality and <strong>memorable</strong> presentation that speaks to refined taste. Many of our loyal customers order our <strong>Garlic Bread</strong> specifically for holidays, festivals, and milestone celebrations where only the finest will do.</p>\n\n<p>It also makes for a thoughtful and appreciated gift, showing care in selection and an understanding of quality that recipients immediately recognize. Whether you are hosting an elaborate event or enjoying a quiet moment of personal indulgence, our <strong>Garlic Bread</strong> rises magnificently to every occasion.</p>\n\n<p>We offer elegant custom packaging options for gifting purposes, ensuring that your present looks as <strong>delectable</strong> as it tastes.</p>\n\n<p>To preserve the <strong>marvelous</strong> quality and freshness of our <strong>Garlic Bread</strong>, we recommend storing it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources. For optimal enjoyment, consume within 2-3 days of purchase, though our delicious creations rarely last that long once discovered. If refrigeration is recommended, please refer to the specific storage guidelines on the packaging for best results.</p>\n\n<p>Our eco-friendly packaging is thoughtfully designed to maintain freshness while minimizing environmental impact. We suggest allowing refrigerated items to come to room temperature before serving to fully appreciate the <strong>delightful</strong> flavors and textures our bakers intended.</p>\n\n<p>Avoid storing near strong-smelling foods as our products may absorb surrounding odors.</p>', 'রোস্টেড রসুন মাখন দিয়ে সুগন্ধযুক্ত রসুন রুটি। মচমচে আবরণ এবং নরম ভেতর। পাস্তা বা স্যুপের সাথে উত্তম।', 120.00, NULL, 37, 3, 0, 1, 1, '2026-03-12 09:30:01', '2026-03-30 06:21:52'),
