both authentically crafted and exceptionally delicious.</p>\n\n<p>The result is a product that not only tastes <strong>signature</strong> but also meets the most stringent standards of food safety and hygiene. We maintain rigorous quality control processes at every stage, from ingredient selection through preparation to final packaging, ensuring that what reaches you is nothing short of perfect.</p>\n\n<p>Our facility undergoes regular audits and adheres to international food safety standards because we believe you deserve complete confidence in every product you purchase from us. When you choose our <strong>Roshmalai</strong>, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations and a dedication to excellence that will never waver.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>Roshmalai</strong> is the perfect choice for <strong>weddings</strong> and <strong>religious ceremonies</strong>, bringing joy and satisfaction to any occasion. The versatile nature of this <strong>splendid</strong> traditional sweet delicacy</strong> makes it equally suitable for casual family gatherings and formal celebrations alike.</p>\n\n<p>Present it at your next dinner party to impress guests with its exceptional quality and <strong>popular</strong> presentation that speaks to refined taste. Many of our loyal customers order our <strong>Roshmalai</strong> specifically for holidays, festivals, and milestone celebrations where only the finest will do.</p>\n\n<p>It also makes for a thoughtful and appreciated gift, showing care in selection and an understanding of quality that recipients immediately recognize. Whether you are hosting an elaborate event or enjoying a quiet moment of personal indulgence, our <strong>Roshmalai</strong> rises magnificently to every occasion.</p>\n\n<p>We offer elegant custom packaging options for gifting purposes, ensuring that your present looks as <strong>magnificent</strong> as it tastes.</p>\n\n<p>To preserve the <strong>nutritious</strong> quality and freshness of our <strong>Roshmalai</strong>, we recommend storing it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources. For optimal enjoyment, consume within 2-3 days of purchase, though our delicious creations rarely last that long once discovered. If refrigeration is recommended, please refer to the specific storage guidelines on the packaging for best results.</p>\n\n<p>Our eco-friendly packaging is thoughtfully designed to maintain freshness while minimizing environmental impact. We suggest allowing refrigerated items to come to room temperature before serving to fully appreciate the <strong>vibrant</strong> flavors and textures our bakers intended.</p>\n\n<p>Avoid storing near strong-smelling foods as our products may absorb surrounding odors.</p>', 'মিষ্টি দুধের ক্রিমে ভাসমান নরম রসমালাই বল। ঐশ্বরিয় স্বাদের সূক্ষ্ম মিষ্টি।', 220.00, 198.00, 78, 6, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-12 09:30:01', '2026-03-30 06:21:52');
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `sku`, `name_en`, `name_bn`, `slug`, `description_en`, `description_bn`, `price`, `sale_price`, `stock`, `category_id`, `views`, `is_featured`, `is_active`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(65, 'SWT-013', 'Mawa', 'মোয়া / মাওয়া', 'mawa', '<p>Indulge in our <strong>DISTINGUISHED</strong> Mawa</strong>, a truly cherished family recipe that has been captivating taste buds for generations. Each creation that leaves our bakery represents the pinnacle of culinary craftsmanship, bringing together time-honored traditions and modern excellence. Our master bakers pour their passion and expertise into every single traditional sweet delicacy, ensuring that you <sup> receive nothing short of perfection.</p>\n\n<p>The journey of our <strong>Mawa</strong> begins long before it reaches your table, starting with the careful selection of only the <strong>extraordinary</strong> ingredients sourced from trusted suppliers who share our commitment to quality. We believe that exceptional food should be an experience that engages all your senses, from the moment you first see its <strong>mouthwatering</strong> appearance to the lingering satisfaction after the last bite.</p>\n\n<p>What truly sets our <strong>Mawa</strong> apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and the pursuit of excellence in every aspect of preparation. From ingredient selection through final packaging, each step undergoes thorough inspection. Our facility adheres to international food safety standards and undergoes regular audits. We believe that quality ingredients make all the difference in the final product. That\'s why we source premium flour, fresh dairy, real spices, and quality sweeteners. Our <strong>Mawa</strong> reflects this dedication to using only the best inputs. When you choose our products, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations.</p>\n\n<p>The flavor profile of our <strong>Mawa</strong> is nothing short of <strong>pure</strong>, presenting a harmonious symphony of <strong>rich</strong> and <strong>authentic</strong> notes that dance gracefully across your palate. Our culinary artisans have spent years perfecting this distinctive character, carefully balancing each element to achieve a taste that is both memorable and deeply satisfying.</p>\n\n<p>The texture is gloriously <strong>creamy</strong> and <strong>spongy</strong>, creating a mouthfeel that provides the perfect complement to the rich flavors. When you take your first bite of our <strong>Mawa</strong>, you will immediately notice the <strong>vibrant</strong> aroma that rises to greet you, hinting at the delicious experience to come. As you continue to savor each morsel, layers of complexity unfold, revealing subtle nuances that make our <strong>traditional sweet delicacy</strong> truly unique.</p>\n\n<p>Customers frequently describe the experience as <strong>signature</strong> and <strong>refreshing</strong>, often remarking how the various flavor components work together in perfect harmony without any single note overwhelming the others. We take great pride in achieving this delicate balance, understanding that the best flavors are those that evolve as you eat, revealing new dimensions with each bite.</p>\n\n<p>The finish is clean yet memorable, leaving a pleasant reminder of the <strong>natural</strong> experience that invites you to return for more.</p>\n\n<p>At our establishment, quality is not merely a goal but the very foundation upon which we build everything we create. Every <strong>Mawa</strong> is prepared fresh using only the <strong>glorious</strong> ingredients available, with absolutely no compromises on quality or freshness. We take great pride in our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers who share our dedication to excellence and sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>traditional sweet delicacy</strong> begins with <strong>pure ghee</strong> and <strong>premium milk solids</strong>, each ingredient carefully chosen for its superior quality and contribution to the final product. Our skilled artisans combine traditional techniques passed down through generations with modern innovations to create products that are both authentically crafted and exceptionally delicious.</p>\n\n<p>The result is a product that not only tastes <strong>rich</strong> but also meets the most stringent standards of food safety and hygiene. We maintain rigorous quality control processes at every stage, from ingredient selection through preparation to final packaging, ensuring that what reaches you is nothing short of perfect.</p>\n\n<p>Our facility undergoes regular audits and adheres to international food safety standards because we believe you deserve complete confidence in every product you purchase from us. When you choose our <strong>Mawa</strong>, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations and a dedication to excellence that will never waver.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>Mawa</strong> is the perfect choice for <strong>religious ceremonies</strong> and <strong>family gatherings</strong>, bringing joy and satisfaction to any occasion. The versatile nature of this <strong>scrumptious</strong> traditional sweet delicacy</strong> makes it equally suitable for casual family gatherings and formal celebrations alike.</p>\n\n<p>Present it at your next dinner party to impress guests with its exceptional quality and <strong>world-class</strong> presentation that speaks to refined taste. Many of our loyal customers order our <strong>Mawa</strong> specifically for holidays, festivals, and milestone celebrations where only the finest will do.</p>\n\n<p>It also makes for a thoughtful and appreciated gift, showing care in selection and an understanding of quality that recipients immediately recognize. Whether you are hosting an elaborate event or enjoying a quiet moment of personal indulgence, our <strong>Mawa</strong> rises magnificently to every occasion.</p>\n\n<p>We offer elegant custom packaging options for gifting purposes, ensuring that your present looks as <strong>premium</strong> as it tastes.</p>\n\n<p>To preserve the <strong>brilliant</strong> quality and freshness of our <strong>Mawa</strong>, we recommend storing it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources. For optimal enjoyment, consume within 2-3 days of purchase, though our delicious creations rarely last that long once discovered. If refrigeration is recommended, please refer to the specific storage guidelines on the packaging for best results.</p>\n\n<p>Our eco-friendly packaging is thoughtfully designed to maintain freshness while minimizing environmental impact. We suggest allowing refrigerated items to come to room temperature before serving to fully appreciate the <strong>gratifying</strong> flavors and textures our bakers intended.</p>\n\n<p>Avoid storing near strong-smelling foods as our products may absorb surrounding odors.</p>', 'জমাট দুধ দিয়ে তৈরি ঐতিহ্যবাহী মাওয়া। কনসেনট্রেটেড দুধের স্বাদ সহ ঘন, সমৃদ্ধ টেক্সচার।', 300.00, NULL, 20, 6, 0, 1, 1, '2026-03-12 09:30:01', '2026-03-30 06:21:52'),
(66, 'SWT-014', 'Shingara', 'শিঙারা / সিংডা', 'shingara', '<p>Indulge in our <strong>ACCLAIMED</strong> Shingara</strong>, a truly treasure of authentic culinary heritage that has been captivating taste buds for generations. Each creation that leaves our bakery represents the pinnacle of culinary craftsmanship, bringing together time-honored traditions and modern excellence. Our master bakers pour their passion and expertise into every single traditional sweet delicacy, ensuring that you <sup> receive nothing short of perfection.</p>\n\n<p>The journey of our <strong>Shingara</strong> begins long before it reaches your table, starting with the careful selection of only the <strong>cherished</strong> ingredients sourced from trusted suppliers who share our commitment to quality. We believe that exceptional food should be an experience that engages all your senses, from the moment you first see its <strong>best-selling</strong> appearance to the lingering satisfaction after the last bite.</p>\n\n<p>What truly sets our <strong>Shingara</strong> apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and the pursuit of excellence in every aspect of preparation. From ingredient selection through final packaging, each step undergoes thorough inspection. Our facility adheres to international food safety standards and undergoes regular audits. We believe that quality ingredients make all the difference in the final product. That\'s why we source premium flour, fresh dairy, real spices, and quality sweeteners. Our <strong>Shingara</strong> reflects this dedication to using only the best inputs. When you choose our products, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations.</p>\n\n<p>The flavor profile of our <strong>Shingara</strong> is nothing short of <strong>spectacular</strong>, presenting a harmonious symphony of <strong>authentic</strong> and <strong>aromatic</strong> notes that dance gracefully across your palate. Our culinary artisans have spent years perfecting this distinctive character, carefully balancing each element to achieve a taste that is both memorable and deeply satisfying.</p>\n\n<p>The texture is gloriously <strong>soft</strong> and <strong>dense</strong>, creating a mouthfeel that provides the perfect complement to the rich flavors. When you take your first bite of our <strong>Shingara</strong>, you will immediately notice the <strong>outstanding</strong> aroma that rises to greet you, hinting at the delicious experience to come. As you continue to savor each morsel, layers of complexity unfold, revealing subtle nuances that make our <strong>traditional sweet delicacy</strong> truly unique.</p>\n\n<p>Customers frequently describe the experience as <strong>popular</strong> and <strong>perfect</strong>, often remarking how the various flavor components work together in perfect harmony without any single note overwhelming the others. We take great pride in achieving this delicate balance, understanding that the best flavors are those that evolve as you eat, revealing new dimensions with each bite.</p>\n\n<p>The finish is clean yet memorable, leaving a pleasant reminder of the <strong>refreshing</strong> experience that invites you to return for more.</p>\n\n<p>At our establishment, quality is not merely a goal but the very foundation upon which we build everything we create. Every <strong>Shingara</strong> is prepared fresh using only the <strong>amazing</strong> ingredients available, with absolutely no compromises on quality or freshness. We take great pride in our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers who share our dedication to excellence and sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>traditional sweet delicacy</strong> begins with <strong>premium milk solids</strong> and <strong>authentic spices</strong>, each ingredient carefully chosen for its superior quality and contribution to the final product. Our skilled artisans combine traditional techniques passed down through generations with modern innovations to create products that are both authentically crafted and exceptionally delicious.</p>\n\n<p>The result is a product that not only tastes <strong>renowned</strong> but also meets the most stringent standards of food safety and hygiene. We maintain rigorous quality control processes at every stage, from ingredient selection through preparation to final packaging, ensuring that what reaches you is nothing short of perfect.</p>\n\n<p>Our facility undergoes regular audits and adheres to international food safety standards because we believe you deserve complete confidence in every product you purchase from us. When you choose our <strong>Shingara</strong>, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations and a dedication to excellence that will never waver.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>Shingara</strong> is the perfect choice for <strong>family gatherings</strong> and <strong>cultural celebrations</strong>, bringing joy and satisfaction to any occasion. The versatile nature of this <strong>wholesome</strong> traditional sweet delicacy</strong> makes it equally suitable for casual family gatherings and formal celebrations alike.</p>\n\n<p>Present it at your next dinner party to impress guests with its exceptional quality and <strong>splendid</strong> presentation that speaks to refined taste. Many of our loyal customers order our <strong>Shingara</strong> specifically for holidays, festivals, and milestone celebrations where only the finest will do.</p>\n\n<p>It also makes for a thoughtful and appreciated gift, showing care in selection and an understanding of quality that recipients immediately recognize. Whether you are hosting an elaborate event or enjoying a quiet moment of personal indulgence, our <strong>Shingara</strong> rises magnificently to every occasion.</p>\n\n<p>We offer elegant custom packaging options for gifting purposes, ensuring that your present looks as <strong>radiant</strong> as it tastes.</p>\n\n<p>To preserve the <strong>specialty</strong> quality and freshness of our <strong>Shingara</strong>, we recommend storing it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources. For optimal enjoyment, consume within 2-3 days of purchase, though our delicious creations rarely last that long once discovered. If refrigeration is recommended, please refer to the specific storage guidelines on the packaging for best results.</p>\n\n<p>Our eco-friendly packaging is thoughtfully designed to maintain freshness while minimizing environmental impact. We suggest allowing refrigerated items to come to room temperature before serving to fully appreciate the <strong>supreme</strong> flavors and textures our bakers intended.</p>\n\n<p>Avoid storing near strong-smelling foods as our products may absorb surrounding odors.</p>', 'মশলাদার সবজি বা মাংস পুর সহ মচমচে সিঙাড়া। স্তরযুক্ত আবরণ সহ জনপ্রিয় বাঙালি স্ন্যাকস।', 40.00, 36.00, 95, 6, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-12 09:30:01', '2026-03-30 06:21:52'),
(67, 'SWT-015', 'Jalebi', 'জিলাপি', 'jalebi', '<p>Indulge in our <strong>BEST-SELLING</strong> Jalebi</strong>, a truly time-honored delicacy that has been captivating taste buds for generations. Each creation that leaves our bakery represents the pinnacle of culinary craftsmanship, bringing together time-honored traditions and modern excellence. Our master bakers pour their passion and expertise into every single traditional sweet delicacy, ensuring that you <sup> receive nothing short of perfection.</p>\n\n<p>The journey of our <strong>Jalebi</strong> begins long before it reaches your table, starting with the careful selection of only the <strong>incredible</strong> ingredients sourced from trusted suppliers who share our commitment to quality. We believe that exceptional food should be an experience that engages all your senses, from the moment you first see its <strong>memorable</strong> appearance to the lingering satisfaction after the last bite.</p>\n\n<p>What truly sets our <strong>Jalebi</strong> apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and the pursuit of excellence in every aspect of preparation. From ingredient selection through final packaging, each step undergoes thorough inspection. Our facility adheres to international food safety standards and undergoes regular audits. We believe that quality ingredients make all the difference in the final product. That\'s why we source premium flour, fresh dairy, real spices, and quality sweeteners. Our <strong>Jalebi</strong> reflects this dedication to using only the best inputs. When you choose our products, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations.</p>\n\n<p>The flavor profile of our <strong>Jalebi</strong> is nothing short of <strong>splendid</strong>, presenting a harmonious symphony of <strong>aromatic</strong> and <strong>deeply satisfying</strong> notes that dance gracefully across your palate. Our culinary artisans have spent years perfecting this distinctive character, carefully balancing each element to achieve a taste that is both memorable and deeply satisfying.</p>\n\n<p>The texture is gloriously <strong>spongy</strong> and <strong>fudge-like</strong>, creating a mouthfeel that provides the perfect complement to the rich flavors. When you take your first bite of our <strong>Jalebi</strong>, you will immediately notice the <strong>divine</strong> aroma that rises to greet you, hinting at the delicious experience to come. As you continue to savor each morsel, layers of complexity unfold, revealing subtle nuances that make our <strong>traditional sweet delicacy</strong> truly unique.</p>\n\n<p>Customers frequently describe the experience as <strong>breathtaking</strong> and <strong>classic</strong>, often remarking how the various flavor components work together in perfect harmony without any single note overwhelming the others. We take great pride in achieving this delicate balance, understanding that the best flavors are those that evolve as you eat, revealing new dimensions with each bite.</p>\n\n<p>The finish is clean yet memorable, leaving a pleasant reminder of the <strong>dazzling</strong> experience that invites you to return for more.</p>\n\n<p>At our establishment, quality is not merely a goal but the very foundation upon which we build everything we create. Every <strong>Jalebi</strong> is prepared fresh using only the <strong>delightful</strong> ingredients available, with absolutely no compromises on quality or freshness. We take great pride in our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers who share our dedication to excellence and sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>traditional sweet delicacy</strong> begins with <strong>authentic spices</strong> and <strong>natural sweeteners</strong>, each ingredient carefully chosen for its superior quality and contribution to the final product. Our skilled artisans combine traditional techniques passed down through generations with modern innovations to create products that are both authentically crafted and exceptionally delicious.</p>\n\n<p>The result is a product that not only tastes <strong>genuine</strong> but also meets the most stringent standards of food safety and hygiene. We maintain rigorous quality control processes at every stage, from ingredient selection through preparation to final packaging, ensuring that what reaches you is nothing short of perfect.</p>\n\n<p>Our facility undergoes regular audits and adheres to international food safety standards because we believe you deserve complete confidence in every product you purchase from us. When you choose our <strong>Jalebi</strong>, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations and a dedication to excellence that will never waver.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>Jalebi</strong> is the perfect choice for <strong>cultural celebrations</strong> and <strong>Eid</strong>, bringing joy and satisfaction to any occasion. The versatile nature of this <strong>extraordinary</strong> traditional sweet delicacy</strong> makes it equally suitable for casual family gatherings and formal celebrations alike.</p>\n\n<p>Present it at your next dinner party to impress guests with its exceptional quality and <strong>ideal</strong> presentation that speaks to refined taste. Many of our loyal customers order our <strong>Jalebi</strong> specifically for holidays, festivals, and milestone celebrations where only the finest will do.</p>\n\n<p>It also makes for a thoughtful and appreciated gift, showing care in selection and an understanding of quality that recipients immediately recognize. Whether you are hosting an elaborate event or enjoying a quiet moment of personal indulgence, our <strong>Jalebi</strong> rises magnificently to every occasion.</p>\n\n<p>We offer elegant custom packaging options for gifting purposes, ensuring that your present looks as <strong>authentic</strong> as it tastes.</p>\n\n<p>To preserve the <strong>top-quality</strong> quality and freshness of our <strong>Jalebi</strong>, we recommend storing it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources. For optimal enjoyment, consume within 2-3 days of purchase, though our delicious creations rarely last that long once discovered. If refrigeration is recommended, please refer to the specific storage guidelines on the packaging for best results.</p>\n\n<p>Our eco-friendly packaging is thoughtfully designed to maintain freshness while minimizing environmental impact. We suggest allowing refrigerated items to come to room temperature before serving to fully appreciate the <strong>original</strong> flavors and textures our bakers intended.</p>\n\n<p>Avoid storing near strong-smelling foods as our products may absorb surrounding odors.</p>', 'জাফরান সিরায় ভেজানো মচমচে, কুণ্ডলী জিলাপি। টক-মিষ্টি স্বাদের উজ্জ্বল কমলা মিষ্টি।', 100.00, NULL, 70, 6, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-12 09:30:01', '2026-03-30 06:21:52'),
