(98, 'PST-005', 'Fruit Pastry', 'ফ্রুট পেস্ট্রি', 'fruit-pastry', '<p>Indulge in our <strong>VIVID</strong> Fruit Pastry</strong>, a truly artisan creation that has been captivating taste buds for generations. Each creation that leaves our bakery represents the pinnacle of culinary craftsmanship, bringing together time-honored traditions and modern excellence. Our master bakers pour their passion and expertise into every single artisan pastry, ensuring that you <sup> receive nothing short of perfection.</p>\n\n<p>The journey of our <strong>Fruit Pastry</strong> begins long before it reaches your table, starting with the careful selection of only the <strong>optimal</strong> ingredients sourced from trusted suppliers who share our commitment to quality. We believe that exceptional food should be an experience that engages all your senses, from the moment you first see its <strong>phenomenal</strong> appearance to the lingering satisfaction after the last bite.</p>\n\n<p>What truly sets our <strong>Fruit Pastry</strong> apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and the pursuit of excellence in every aspect of preparation. From ingredient selection through final packaging, each step undergoes thorough inspection. Our facility adheres to international food safety standards and undergoes regular audits. We believe that quality ingredients make all the difference in the final product. That\'s why we source premium flour, fresh dairy, real spices, and quality sweeteners. Our <strong>Fruit Pastry</strong> reflects this dedication to using only the best inputs. When you choose our products, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations.</p>\n\n<p>The flavor profile of our <strong>Fruit Pastry</strong> is nothing short of <strong>top-quality</strong>, presenting a harmonious symphony of <strong>exquisitely crafted</strong> and <strong>layered</strong> notes that dance gracefully across your palate. Our culinary artisans have spent years perfecting this distinctive character, carefully balancing each element to achieve a taste that is both memorable and deeply satisfying.</p>\n\n<p>The texture is gloriously <strong>crisp</strong> and <strong>light</strong>, creating a mouthfeel that provides the perfect complement to the rich flavors. When you take your first bite of our <strong>Fruit Pastry</strong>, you will immediately notice the <strong>radiant</strong> aroma that rises to greet you, hinting at the delicious experience to come. As you continue to savor each morsel, layers of complexity unfold, revealing subtle nuances that make our <strong>artisan pastry</strong> truly unique.</p>\n\n<p>Customers frequently describe the experience as <strong>supreme</strong> and <strong>timeless</strong>, often remarking how the various flavor components work together in perfect harmony without any single note overwhelming the others. We take great pride in achieving this delicate balance, understanding that the best flavors are those that evolve as you eat, revealing new dimensions with each bite.</p>\n\n<p>The finish is clean yet memorable, leaving a pleasant reminder of the <strong>prominent</strong> experience that invites you to return for more.</p>\n\n<p>At our establishment, quality is not merely a goal but the very foundation upon which we build everything we create. Every <strong>Fruit Pastry</strong> is prepared fresh using only the <strong>preferred</strong> ingredients available, with absolutely no compromises on quality or freshness. We take great pride in our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers who share our dedication to excellence and sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>artisan pastry</strong> begins with <strong>premium cheese</strong> and <strong>seasonal vegetables</strong>, each ingredient carefully chosen for its superior quality and contribution to the final product. Our skilled artisans combine traditional techniques passed down through generations with modern innovations to create products that are both authentically crafted and exceptionally delicious.</p>\n\n<p>The result is a product that not only tastes <strong>gratifying</strong> but also meets the most stringent standards of food safety and hygiene. We maintain rigorous quality control processes at every stage, from ingredient selection through preparation to final packaging, ensuring that what reaches you is nothing short of perfect.</p>\n\n<p>Our facility undergoes regular audits and adheres to international food safety standards because we believe you deserve complete confidence in every product you purchase from us. When you choose our <strong>Fruit Pastry</strong>, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations and a dedication to excellence that will never waver.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>Fruit Pastry</strong> is the perfect choice for <strong>picnics</strong> and <strong>appetizers</strong>, bringing joy and satisfaction to any occasion. The versatile nature of this <strong>impressive</strong> artisan pastry</strong> makes it equally suitable for casual family gatherings and formal celebrations alike.</p>\n\n<p>Present it at your next dinner party to impress guests with its exceptional quality and <strong>memorable</strong> presentation that speaks to refined taste. Many of our loyal customers order our <strong>Fruit Pastry</strong> specifically for holidays, festivals, and milestone celebrations where only the finest will do.</p>\n\n<p>It also makes for a thoughtful and appreciated gift, showing care in selection and an understanding of quality that recipients immediately recognize. Whether you are hosting an elaborate event or enjoying a quiet moment of personal indulgence, our <strong>Fruit Pastry</strong> rises magnificently to every occasion.</p>\n\n<p>We offer elegant custom packaging options for gifting purposes, ensuring that your present looks as <strong>satisfying</strong> as it tastes.</p>\n\n<p>To preserve the <strong>delectable</strong> quality and freshness of our <strong>Fruit Pastry</strong>, we recommend storing it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources. For optimal enjoyment, consume within 2-3 days of purchase, though our delicious creations rarely last that long once discovered. If refrigeration is recommended, please refer to the specific storage guidelines on the packaging for best results.</p>\n\n<p>Our eco-friendly packaging is thoughtfully designed to maintain freshness while minimizing environmental impact. We suggest allowing refrigerated items to come to room temperature before serving to fully appreciate the <strong>intense</strong> flavors and textures our bakers intended.</p>\n\n<p>Avoid storing near strong-smelling foods as our products may absorb surrounding odors.</p>', 'মৌসুমি ফল দিয়ে টপ করা তাজা ফ্রুট পেস্ট্রি। তাজা ফল টপিং সহ হালকা পেস্ট্রি ক্রিম বেস।', 65.00, NULL, 33, 9, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-12 09:30:01', '2026-03-30 06:21:52'),
(99, 'PST-006', 'Croissant', 'ক্রোইসান / ফ্রেঞ্চ রোল', 'croissant', '<p>Indulge in our <strong>BRILLIANT</strong> Croissant</strong>, a truly flaky masterpiece of patisserie excellence that has been captivating taste buds for generations. Each creation that leaves our bakery represents the pinnacle of culinary craftsmanship, bringing together time-honored traditions and modern excellence. Our master bakers pour their passion and expertise into every single artisan pastry, ensuring that you <sup> receive nothing short of perfection.</p>\n\n<p>The journey of our <strong>Croissant</strong> begins long before it reaches your table, starting with the careful selection of only the <strong>prominent</strong> ingredients sourced from trusted suppliers who share our commitment to quality. We believe that exceptional food should be an experience that engages all your senses, from the moment you first see its <strong>premium</strong> appearance to the lingering satisfaction after the last bite.</p>\n\n<p>What truly sets our <strong>Croissant</strong> apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and the pursuit of excellence in every aspect of preparation. From ingredient selection through final packaging, each step undergoes thorough inspection. Our facility adheres to international food safety standards and undergoes regular audits. We believe that quality ingredients make all the difference in the final product. That\'s why we source premium flour, fresh dairy, real spices, and quality sweeteners. Our <strong>Croissant</strong> reflects this dedication to using only the best inputs. When you choose our products, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations.</p>\n\n<p>The flavor profile of our <strong>Croissant</strong> is nothing short of <strong>flawless</strong>, presenting a harmonious symphony of <strong>layered</strong> and <strong>complex</strong> notes that dance gracefully across your palate. Our culinary artisans have spent years perfecting this distinctive character, carefully balancing each element to achieve a taste that is both memorable and deeply satisfying.</p>\n\n<p>The texture is gloriously <strong>tender</strong> and <strong>flaky</strong>, creating a mouthfeel that provides the perfect complement to the rich flavors. When you take your first bite of our <strong>Croissant</strong>, you will immediately notice the <strong>outstanding</strong> aroma that rises to greet you, hinting at the delicious experience to come. As you continue to savor each morsel, layers of complexity unfold, revealing subtle nuances that make our <strong>artisan pastry</strong> truly unique.</p>\n\n<p>Customers frequently describe the experience as <strong>ultimate</strong> and <strong>scrumptious</strong>, often remarking how the various flavor components work together in perfect harmony without any single note overwhelming the others. We take great pride in achieving this delicate balance, understanding that the best flavors are those that evolve as you eat, revealing new dimensions with each bite.</p>\n\n<p>The finish is clean yet memorable, leaving a pleasant reminder of the <strong>gratifying</strong> experience that invites you to return for more.</p>\n\n<p>At our establishment, quality is not merely a goal but the very foundation upon which we build everything we create. Every <strong>Croissant</strong> is prepared fresh using only the <strong>legendary</strong> ingredients available, with absolutely no compromises on quality or freshness. We take great pride in our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers who share our dedication to excellence and sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>artisan pastry</strong> begins with <strong>seasonal vegetables</strong> and <strong>French butter</strong>, each ingredient carefully chosen for its superior quality and contribution to the final product. Our skilled artisans combine traditional techniques passed down through generations with modern innovations to create products that are both authentically crafted and exceptionally delicious.</p>\n\n<p>The result is a product that not only tastes <strong>perfect</strong> but also meets the most stringent standards of food safety and hygiene. We maintain rigorous quality control processes at every stage, from ingredient selection through preparation to final packaging, ensuring that what reaches you is nothing short of perfect.</p>\n\n<p>Our facility undergoes regular audits and adheres to international food safety standards because we believe you deserve complete confidence in every product you purchase from us. When you choose our <strong>Croissant</strong>, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations and a dedication to excellence that will never waver.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>Croissant</strong> is the perfect choice for <strong>appetizers</strong> and <strong>breakfast</strong>, bringing joy and satisfaction to any occasion. The versatile nature of this <strong>rich</strong> artisan pastry</strong> makes it equally suitable for casual family gatherings and formal celebrations alike.</p>\n\n<p>Present it at your next dinner party to impress guests with its exceptional quality and <strong>famous</strong> presentation that speaks to refined taste. Many of our loyal customers order our <strong>Croissant</strong> specifically for holidays, festivals, and milestone celebrations where only the finest will do.</p>\n\n<p>It also makes for a thoughtful and appreciated gift, showing care in selection and an understanding of quality that recipients immediately recognize. Whether you are hosting an elaborate event or enjoying a quiet moment of personal indulgence, our <strong>Croissant</strong> rises magnificently to every occasion.</p>\n\n<p>We offer elegant custom packaging options for gifting purposes, ensuring that your present looks as <strong>divine</strong> as it tastes.</p>\n\n<p>To preserve the <strong>wholesome</strong> quality and freshness of our <strong>Croissant</strong>, we recommend storing it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources. For optimal enjoyment, consume within 2-3 days of purchase, though our delicious creations rarely last that long once discovered. If refrigeration is recommended, please refer to the specific storage guidelines on the packaging for best results.</p>\n\n<p>Our eco-friendly packaging is thoughtfully designed to maintain freshness while minimizing environmental impact. We suggest allowing refrigerated items to come to room temperature before serving to fully appreciate the <strong>favorite</strong> flavors and textures our bakers intended.</p>\n\n<p>Avoid storing near strong-smelling foods as our products may absorb surrounding odors.</p>', 'ক্লাসিক অর্ধচন্দ্রাকৃতির মাখনযুক্ত ক্রোয়াঁসাঁ। সকালের নাস্তার জন্য মচমচে, সোনালি স্তর।', 70.00, 63.00, 62, 9, 0, 1, 1, '2026-03-12 09:30:01', '2026-03-30 06:21:52');
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `sku`, `name_en`, `name_bn`, `slug`, `description_en`, `description_bn`, `price`, `sale_price`, `stock`, `category_id`, `views`, `is_featured`, `is_active`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(100, 'PST-007', 'Danish Pastry', 'ড্যানিশ পেস্ট্রি / লেয়ার্ড পেস্ট্রি', 'danish-pastry', '<p>Indulge in our <strong>PHENOMENAL</strong> Danish Pastry</strong>, a truly golden layers of perfection that has been captivating taste buds for generations. Each creation that leaves our bakery represents the pinnacle of culinary craftsmanship, bringing together time-honored traditions and modern excellence. Our master bakers pour their passion and expertise into every single artisan pastry, ensuring that you <sup> receive nothing short of perfection.</p>\n\n<p>The journey of our <strong>Danish Pastry</strong> begins long before it reaches your table, starting with the careful selection of only the <strong>fresh</strong> ingredients sourced from trusted suppliers who share our commitment to quality. We believe that exceptional food should be an experience that engages all your senses, from the moment you first see its <strong>glorious</strong> appearance to the lingering satisfaction after the last bite.</p>\n\n<p>What truly sets our <strong>Danish Pastry</strong> apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and the pursuit of excellence in every aspect of preparation. From ingredient selection through final packaging, each step undergoes thorough inspection. Our facility adheres to international food safety standards and undergoes regular audits. We believe that quality ingredients make all the difference in the final product. That\'s why we source premium flour, fresh dairy, real spices, and quality sweeteners. Our <strong>Danish Pastry</strong> reflects this dedication to using only the best inputs. When you choose our products, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations.</p>\n\n<p>The flavor profile of our <strong>Danish Pastry</strong> is nothing short of <strong>enjoyable</strong>, presenting a harmonious symphony of <strong>complex</strong> and <strong>sophisticated</strong> notes that dance gracefully across your palate. Our culinary artisans have spent years perfecting this distinctive character, carefully balancing each element to achieve a taste that is both memorable and deeply satisfying.</p>\n\n<p>The texture is gloriously <strong>light</strong> and <strong>golden</strong>, creating a mouthfeel that provides the perfect complement to the rich flavors. When you take your first bite of our <strong>Danish Pastry</strong>, you will immediately notice the <strong>award-winning</strong> aroma that rises to greet you, hinting at the delicious experience to come. As you continue to savor each morsel, layers of complexity unfold, revealing subtle nuances that make our <strong>artisan pastry</strong> truly unique.</p>\n\n<p>Customers frequently describe the experience as <strong>prominent</strong> and <strong>iconic</strong>, often remarking how the various flavor components work together in perfect harmony without any single note overwhelming the others. We take great pride in achieving this delicate balance, understanding that the best flavors are those that evolve as you eat, revealing new dimensions with each bite.</p>\n\n<p>The finish is clean yet memorable, leaving a pleasant reminder of the <strong>world-class</strong> experience that invites you to return for more.</p>\n\n<p>At our establishment, quality is not merely a goal but the very foundation upon which we build everything we create. Every <strong>Danish Pastry</strong> is prepared fresh using only the <strong>scrumptious</strong> ingredients available, with absolutely no compromises on quality or freshness. We take great pride in our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers who share our dedication to excellence and sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>artisan pastry</strong> begins with <strong>French butter</strong> and <strong>all-butter puff pastry</strong>, each ingredient carefully chosen for its superior quality and contribution to the final product. Our skilled artisans combine traditional techniques passed down through generations with modern innovations to create products that are both authentically crafted and exceptionally delicious.</p>\n\n<p>The result is a product that not only tastes <strong>superb</strong> but also meets the most stringent standards of food safety and hygiene. We maintain rigorous quality control processes at every stage, from ingredient selection through preparation to final packaging, ensuring that what reaches you is nothing short of perfect.</p>\n\n<p>Our facility undergoes regular audits and adheres to international food safety standards because we believe you deserve complete confidence in every product you purchase from us. When you choose our <strong>Danish Pastry</strong>, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations and a dedication to excellence that will never waver.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>Danish Pastry</strong> is the perfect choice for <strong>breakfast</strong> and <strong>brunch</strong>, bringing joy and satisfaction to any occasion. The versatile nature of this <strong>optimal</strong> artisan pastry</strong> makes it equally suitable for casual family gatherings and formal celebrations alike.</p>\n\n<p>Present it at your next dinner party to impress guests with its exceptional quality and <strong>beloved</strong> presentation that speaks to refined taste. Many of our loyal customers order our <strong>Danish Pastry</strong> specifically for holidays, festivals, and milestone celebrations where only the finest will do.</p>\n\n<p>It also makes for a thoughtful and appreciated gift, showing care in selection and an understanding of quality that recipients immediately recognize. Whether you are hosting an elaborate event or enjoying a quiet moment of personal indulgence, our <strong>Danish Pastry</strong> rises magnificently to every occasion.</p>\n\n<p>We offer elegant custom packaging options for gifting purposes, ensuring that your present looks as <strong>fantastic</strong> as it tastes.</p>\n\n<p>To preserve the <strong>ideal</strong> quality and freshness of our <strong>Danish Pastry</strong>, we recommend storing it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources. For optimal enjoyment, consume within 2-3 days of purchase, though our delicious creations rarely last that long once discovered. If refrigeration is recommended, please refer to the specific storage guidelines on the packaging for best results.</p>\n\n<p>Our eco-friendly packaging is thoughtfully designed to maintain freshness while minimizing environmental impact. We suggest allowing refrigerated items to come to room temperature before serving to fully appreciate the <strong>outstanding</strong> flavors and textures our bakers intended.</p>\n\n<p>Avoid storing near strong-smelling foods as our products may absorb surrounding odors.</p>', 'ফল বা ক্রিম ফিলিং সহ ড্যানিশ পেস্ট্রি। মাখনযুক্ত পেস্ট্রি ডো এর একাধিক স্তর।', 75.00, 67.50, 19, 9, 0, 1, 1, '2026-03-12 09:30:01', '2026-03-30 06:21:52'),
(101, 'PST-008', 'Sausage Roll', 'সসেজ রোল', 'sausage-roll', '<p>Indulge in our <strong>BRILLIANT</strong> Sausage Roll</strong>, a truly artisan creation that has been captivating taste buds for generations. Each creation that leaves our bakery represents the pinnacle of culinary craftsmanship, bringing together time-honored traditions and modern excellence. Our master bakers pour their passion and expertise into every single artisan pastry, ensuring that you <sup> receive nothing short of perfection.</p>\n\n<p>The journey of our <strong>Sausage Roll</strong> begins long before it reaches your table, starting with the careful selection of only the <strong>acclaimed</strong> ingredients sourced from trusted suppliers who share our commitment to quality. We believe that exceptional food should be an experience that engages all your senses, from the moment you first see its <strong>preferred</strong> appearance to the lingering satisfaction after the last bite.</p>\n\n<p>What truly sets our <strong>Sausage Roll</strong> apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and the pursuit of excellence in every aspect of preparation. From ingredient selection through final packaging, each step undergoes thorough inspection. Our facility adheres to international food safety standards and undergoes regular audits. We believe that quality ingredients make all the difference in the final product. That\'s why we source premium flour, fresh dairy, real spices, and quality sweeteners. Our <strong>Sausage Roll</strong> reflects this dedication to using only the best inputs. When you choose our products, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations.</p>\n\n<p>The flavor profile of our <strong>Sausage Roll</strong> is nothing short of <strong>fantastic</strong>, presenting a harmonious symphony of <strong>sophisticated</strong> and <strong>buttery</strong> notes that dance gracefully across your palate. Our culinary artisans have spent years perfecting this distinctive character, carefully balancing each element to achieve a taste that is both memorable and deeply satisfying.</p>\n\n<p>The texture is gloriously <strong>flaky</strong> and <strong>crisp</strong>, creating a mouthfeel that provides the perfect complement to the rich flavors. When you take your first bite of our <strong>Sausage Roll</strong>, you will immediately notice the <strong>delightful</strong> aroma that rises to greet you, hinting at the delicious experience to come. As you continue to savor each morsel, layers of complexity unfold, revealing subtle nuances that make our <strong>artisan pastry</strong> truly unique.</p>\n\n<p>Customers frequently describe the experience as <strong>intense</strong> and <strong>cherished</strong>, often remarking how the various flavor components work together in perfect harmony without any single note overwhelming the others. We take great pride in achieving this delicate balance, understanding that the best flavors are those that evolve as you eat, revealing new dimensions with each bite.</p>\n\n<p>The finish is clean yet memorable, leaving a pleasant reminder of the <strong>wholesome</strong> experience that invites you to return for more.</p>\n\n<p>At our establishment, quality is not merely a goal but the very foundation upon which we build everything we create. Every <strong>Sausage Roll</strong> is prepared fresh using only the <strong>specialty</strong> ingredients available, with absolutely no compromises on quality or freshness. We take great pride in our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers who share our dedication to excellence and sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>artisan pastry</strong> begins with <strong>all-butter puff pastry</strong> and <strong>fresh herbs</strong>, each ingredient carefully chosen for its superior quality and contribution to the final product. Our skilled artisans combine traditional techniques passed down through generations with modern innovations to create products that are both authentically crafted and exceptionally delicious.</p>\n\n<p>The result is a product that not only tastes <strong>exceptional</strong> but also meets the most stringent standards of food safety and hygiene. We maintain rigorous quality control processes at every stage, from ingredient selection through preparation to final packaging, ensuring that what reaches you is nothing short of perfect.</p>\n\n<p>Our facility undergoes regular audits and adheres to international food safety standards because we believe you deserve complete confidence in every product you purchase from us. When you choose our <strong>Sausage Roll</strong>, you are choosing a commitment to quality that spans generations and a dedication to excellence that will never waver.</p>\n\n<p>Our <strong>Sausage Roll</strong> is the perfect choice for <strong>brunch</strong> and <strong>parties</strong>, bringing joy and satisfaction to any occasion. The versatile nature of this <strong>wonderful</strong> artisan pastry</strong> makes it equally suitable for casual family gatherings and formal celebrations alike.</p>\n\n<p>Present it at your next dinner party to impress guests with its exceptional quality and <strong>renowned</strong> presentation that speaks to refined taste. Many of our loyal customers order our <strong>Sausage Roll</strong> specifically for holidays, festivals, and milestone celebrations where only the finest will do.</p>\n\n<p>It also makes for a thoughtful and appreciated gift, showing care in selection and an understanding of quality that recipients immediately recognize. Whether you are hosting an elaborate event or enjoying a quiet moment of personal indulgence, our <strong>Sausage Roll</strong> rises magnificently to every occasion.</p>\n\n<p>We offer elegant custom packaging options for gifting purposes, ensuring that your present looks as <strong>ideal</strong> as it tastes.</p>\n\n<p>To preserve the <strong>timeless</strong> quality and freshness of our <strong>Sausage Roll</strong>, we recommend storing it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources. For optimal enjoyment, consume within 2-3 days of purchase, though our delicious creations rarely last that long once discovered. If refrigeration is recommended, please refer to the specific storage guidelines on the packaging for best results.</p>\n\n<p>Our eco-friendly packaging is thoughtfully designed to maintain freshness while minimizing environmental impact. We suggest allowing refrigerated items to come to room temperature before serving to fully appreciate the <strong>superior</strong> flavors and textures our bakers intended.</p>\n\n<p>Avoid storing near strong-smelling foods as our products may absorb surrounding odors.</p>', 'মশলাদার সসেজ সহ সুস্বাদু সসেজ রোল। রসালো সসেজের চারপাশে মোড়ানো পাফ পেস্ট্রি।', 80.00, NULL, 96, 9, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-12 09:30:01', '2026-03-30 06:21:52'),
